<title>USA: MBIA sees Q2 EPS in line with estimates.</title>
<headline>MBIA sees Q2 EPS in line with estimates.</headline>
<dateline>ARMONK, N.Y. 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>MBIA Inc said Thursday it expects its second quarter operating earnings to be in line with First Call consensus estimates.</p>
<p>Analysts estimate the quarter's earnings per share at $2.00, according to First Call.</p>
<p>The municipal bond insurer also said it expects gross premiums written to be up about 20 percent over the second quarter of last year.</p>
<p>The company's second quarter results are scheduled to be released on August 5.</p>
</text>
